    "notes": "The red-and-white façade, raised berm, open membrane roof and central mast identify Warsaw’s National Stadium at all four viewer distances. Closer models add the approach steps, two seating tiers and hospitality ribbons, roof glazing and radial cables, suspended scoreboard and the expanded-metal façade. The public elevation tiles give approximate street and berm contact. Cable sag, seats and the color distribution of the mesh panels are reconstructed from photographs."
